; ==========================================
; First Steps in Greek / Ελληνικά (el)
; MultiLang-ASM Kids
; ==========================================

bale kouti 10       ; Put 10 candies in the box
prosthese kouti 5        ; Get 5 more candies (15)
afairese kouti 2        ; Eat 2 candies (13 left!)
diekse kouti         ; Show the final candy count!
